{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Map provider guard",
  "description": "Re-check provider policy, error contract and cost guardrails whenever the map module changes.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "OnMyWay_BE_V2/src/modules/map/**/*.ts"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "The map module changed. Check the edit against .kiro/steering/map-provider-policy.md: no cross-provider fallback was introduced; Korea routes stay Kakao-only and all-abroad routes stay Google-only; errors are still normalized to the five MAP_PROVIDER_* codes without raw upstream payloads; null place fields stay UNKNOWN and are never coerced to false; Google FieldMask, vertex (<=10) and page (<=3) limits are unchanged or their cost impact is documented in docs/FEATURE_INSIGHTS.md. Then run `corepack pnpm --dir OnMyWay_BE_V2 lint`, `build` and `test --runInBand` and report the results."
  }
}
